subckt dut (VSS Vo)
CC1 (net2 Vg) capacitor c=1p
CC2 (net3 Vo) capacitor c=1p
CS (net1 VSS) capacitor c=1p
G1 (net3 Vg Vg net1) vccs gm=gm
R1 (Vg net1) resistor r=1/gm
RD (net3 VSS) resistor r=1k
RG1 (Vg VSS) resistor r=1k
RG2 (Vg VSS) resistor r=1k
RL (Vo VSS) resistor r=1k
RS (net1 VSS) resistor r=1k
Rsig (net0 net2) resistor r=1k
Vsig (net0 VSS) vsource dc=1
